Package: lh-tpm2-provisioner
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Sameer Tawade <ops@logihertz.com>
Homepage: https://www.logihertz.com
Description: lh-tpm2 - TPM 2.0 SHA-256 Platform Configuration Register Extension
 Zero-dependency C11 hardware TPM 2.0 provisioning engine implementing ISO/IEC 11889 TPM2_PCR_Extend, TPM2_PolicyPCR (0x0000017F) trial sessions, PCR-bound LUKS secret sealing, and TPMS_ATTEST quote verification.
